--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" data-testid="faq-panel" class="h-(--accordion-panel-height) overflow-hidden transition-[height,opacity] duration-slow ease-smooth-out data-[starting-style]:h-0 data-[starting-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:h-0 data-[ending-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:duration-medium motion-reduce:transition-opacity motion-reduce:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[starting-style]:h-auto motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:h-auto text-body leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;div]:pb-4"><div class="pb-3 pt-0"><p class="mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-6 last:mb-0">GPT Image 2.5 Flare is an image generation and editing model from OpenAI, positioned as the speed-oriented tier of the GPT Image 2.5 series. It is suited to high-volume everyday generation, creator content, and rapid prototyping via the dedicated Images API.</p></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="border-b border-border last:border-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="flex"><button type="button" data-value="" data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_1daepbqubsnqbt3dml9ivbH2_" tabindex="0" class="flex flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between font-medium transition-colors duration-fast ease-smooth-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-focus-border focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-panel-open]&gt;svg.accordion-chevron]:-scale-y-100 gap-4 py-4 text-left text-base hover:text-foreground">How much does GPT Image 2.5 Flare cost?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down accordion-chevron size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform 