00/M tokens, Text Input at $5.00/M tokens, and Image Output at $30.00/M tokens.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What image aspect ratios does GPT Image 2.5 Flare support?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GPT Image 2.5 Flare supports the 1:1, 3:2, 2:3, 4:3, 3:4, 16:9 and 2 more aspect ratios and can generate up to 10 images per request.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What inputs and outputs does GPT Image 2.5 Flare support?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GPT Image 2.5 Flare accepts text and images as input and returns images. Up to 16 reference images can be attached to one request for image editing.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What other image models does OpenAI have?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst, GPT Image 2, GPT Image 1 Mini and 1 more are other image models from OpenAI.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When was GPT Image 2.5 Flare released?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GPT Image 2.5 Flare was released on September 9, 2026.\"}}]}7c:[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"faq\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+129px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+70px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] mb-10 last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\