ng, agentic, and chat workloads, use [GPT-6.1 Sol](https://openrouter.ai/openai/gpt-6.1-sol) instead.\\n\\nLearn more in OpenAI's docs: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/reasoning#reasoning-mode\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-29T17:28:06.435Z\",\"context_length\":1050000,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"openai/gpt-6.1-sol-pro\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"openai/gpt-6.1-sol-pro-20260929\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.000002\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.000002\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.000004\"}]},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.00001\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.00001\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.000015\"}]},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.0000001\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.0000001\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.0000002\"}]},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Write\",\"price\":\"0.0000025\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.0000025\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.000005\"}]},{\"kind\":\"unit\",\"sku_label\":\"Web Search\",\"price\":\"0.01\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000,\"unitLabel\":\"/1K calls\",\"isServerTool\":true}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.000002\",\"completion\":\"0.00001\",\"web_search\":\"0.01\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.0000001\",\"input_cache_write\":\"0.0000025\",\"discount\":0,\"overrides\":[{\"min_prompt_tokens\":272000,\"prompt\":\"0.000004\",\"completion\":\"0.000015\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.0000002\",\"input_cache_write\":\"0.000005\"}]}}},{\"slug\":\"openai/gpt-6.1-sol\",\"permaslug\":\"openai/gpt-6.1-sol-20260929\",\"name\":\"OpenAI: GPT-6.1 Sol\",\"description\":\"GPT-6.1 Sol is an upgrade to GPT-6 Sol from OpenAI, positioned below the flagship GPT-6 Astra in the GPT-6 series. It is suited for agentic coding, computer use, document-heavy professional work, and multi-step business workflow automation, and approaches Astra-level results on these tasks at a much lower cost. Compared with GPT-6 Sol, it makes fewer factual errors and is more reliable at respecting explicit restrictions and user intent during agentic tasks.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-29T17:28:02.489Z\",\"context_length\":1050000,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"openai/gpt-6.1-sol\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"openai/gpt-6.1-sol-20260929\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.000002\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.000002\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.000004\"}]},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.00001\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.00001\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.000015\"}]},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.0000001\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.0000001\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.0000002\"}]},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Write\",\"price\":\"0.0000025\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.0000025\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.000005\"}]},{\"kind\":\"unit\",\"sku_label\":\"Web Search\",\"price\":\"0.01\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000,\"unitLabel\":\"/1K calls\",\"isServerTool\":true}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.000002\",\"completion\":\"0.00001\",\"web_search\":\"0.01\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.0000001\",\"input_cache_write\":\"0.0000025\",\"discount\":0,\"overrides\":[{\"min_prompt_tokens\":272000,\"prompt\":\"0.000004\",\"completion\":\"0.000015\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.0000002\",\"input_cache_write\":\"0.000005\"}]}}},{\"slug\":\"openai/gpt-6-luna-pro\",\"permaslug\":\"openai/gpt-6-luna-pro-20260922\",\"name\":\"OpenAI: GPT-6 Luna Pro\",\"description\":\"GPT-6 Luna Pro is the same underlying model as [GPT-6 Luna](https://openrouter.ai/openai/gpt-6-luna), served with `reasoning.mode` set to `pro` for higher-quality responses on complex tasks.\\n\\n**Cost note:** pro mode spends far more reasoning tokens per request, so a typical request costs several times more than the same request on GPT-6 Luna and takes much longer to complete. It is intended for hard, high-stakes problems where the extra accuracy justifies the cost. For everyday coding, agentic, and chat workloads, use [GPT-6 Luna](https://openrouter.ai/openai/gpt-6-luna) instead.\\n\\nLearn more in OpenAI's docs: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/reasoning#reasoning-mode\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-22T18:13:11.132Z\",\"context_length\":1050000,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"openai/gpt-6-luna-pro\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"openai/gpt-6-luna-pro-20260922\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000001\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.0000001\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.0000002\"}]},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000005\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\",\"tiers\":[{\"sku_label\":\"≤272K\",\"price\":\"0.0000005\"},{\"sku_label\":\"\u003e272K\",\"price\":\"0.00000075\"}]},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.00000001\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"